  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rangeland Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation of the CBRLM sub-activity, which requires monitoring and evaluation actions to take place in a similar number of working group communities and control group communities . One focal area for the evaluation will be to assess to what extent the intervention has led to improvements in rangeland health in the working group vs. the control group communities, as determined by periodic measurements of a few (2-3) simple related indicators.</narrative>
  </description>
